kind":"announcement","title":"HOLD MY WHEEL demo added 10,000 times — thank you!","summary":"Friends, this is incredible — the HOLD MY WHEEL demo has been added to libraries more than 10,000 times! That's a huge number for us. Thank you to everyone who downloaded it, played it and shared it with friends. Your feedback means a lot to us Thank you to everyone who messages us directly — we read every single message. But we have one request: please share your thoughts on the game's Steam page too. Activity on the page directly affects whether Steam's algorithms show the game to other player","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:42:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033856","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:49:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410360-1846651706684496","game_id":"steam-4410360","kind":"announcement","title":"Get Your Name in the Game","summary":"CARVE YOUR NAME INTO THE WASTELAND!Want to become part of Hold My Wheel forever? Here’s your chance! Record your Hold My Wheel gameplayDrop the video link in the comments belowGet a chance to have your channel name engraved on a monument hidden somewhere in the game worldVideos from both the demo and the full game (after its November 3 release) count. Play the demo now:And no, this isn’t a “one lucky winner” deal. We’ve got a LOT of space on those monuments, so a lot of you will make it in. The ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:48:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684496","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410360-1844115010503318","game_id":"steam-4410360","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out Now!","summary":"The HOLD MY WHEEL demo has landed. Team up with your idiot twin brothers, patch up the bus, and scavenge your way through the wasteland toward grandma's house. Fight zombies, dodge disaster, and try not to lose the bus - it's the only home you've got. Play it now and let us know what you think!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T06:35:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503318","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410360-1842846814449246","game_id":"steam-4410360","kind":"announcement","title":"FIRST BUGS FIXED","summary":"Huge thanks for your videos, we really appreciate this contribution. We'll gladly give you a spot inside the game, just send us your nickname. Big respect to everyone who found those first critical bugs, I'm really glad you helped us out!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T15:23:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449246","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410360-1842846814447766","game_id":"steam-4410360","kind":"announcement","title":"PLAYTEST IS NOW OPEN","summary":"The playtest is open! 🎮 Hold My Wheel is now playable — grab the wheel and jump in. What's in it: New features — fresh content we haven't shown anywhere yet Find bugs — break the game and help us fix it Share feedback — what you say shapes the release build How to join: Hit \"Request Access\" on the Steam page — access is granted automatically. ➜ Join the playtest: Thanks for helping out! Drop anything you spot in the discussions — we read every message.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T20:32:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/external